# Repo conventions

```
frameworks/           # shared ELC constants (inherit these)
courses/<CODE>/       # one folder per course code (MCF3M, …)
  AGENTS.md           # course agent notes (inherits frameworks/)
  sources/            # PDFs, IMSCC, immutable inputs (+ textbook extracts)
  curriculum/         # expectations DB + markdown
  canvas/             # IMSCC inventory + gitignored unpacked/
  live-lessons/       # SMART Notebook sync materials + inventory
  modules/            # lesson/module drafts (async + reference banks)
agents/               # cross-cutting agent prompts
scripts/              # tooling
```

- New courses copy the `courses/MCF3M/` shape and inherit `frameworks/` + root `AGENTS.md`.
- Harness specialized agents for trickle-down work (curriculum, semester, Canvas IMSCC, SMART Notebook, async lessons, textbook/Nelson banks) — see root `AGENTS.md`.
- Textbook reference banks live under `modules/<module>/questions/` (see `frameworks/textbook-question-bank.md`); do not conflate with live lesson sqlite.
- Course module/lesson inventories are baselines for rebuilds, not frozen IA; preserve source archives when restructuring.
- Put shared school rules only under `frameworks/` or `.cursor/rules/`, not duplicated per course.
- Teaching content > app scaffolding. Docstrings required on new functions/methods.
- Do not commit unless explicitly asked.
